.SH NAME
QLayoutItem \- The abstract items which a QLayout manipulates
.SH SYNOPSIS
.br
.PP
\fC#include <qabstractlayout.h>\fR
.PP
Inherited by QLayout, QSpacerItem and QWidgetItem.
.PP
